      "id": "claim_1c5525d7014246099c3ccac56ca69284",
      "statement": "The Podbean integration is the catalogue ingestion layer that feeds the podcast listing, per-episode pages, and Studio sync planning from the public RSS feed rather than authenticated Podbean APIs.",
